{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t運輸署今早接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，運輸及物流局局長陳美寶表示，局方高度重視事件，已經責承運輸署，要求營運商香港電訊盡快提交報告。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n陳美寶說，已經與警方聯絡，在系統未完全復修前，警方不會在路旁泊車位執法。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:02.224646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:17:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:59:10.282122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:52.450060+00:00","content_hash":"9b7835f14a0acd58b672768f1f2c2f5aa44f6e9f64732967e21df983f326cefe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}